		W E L C O M E   T O   O S / 7 8  !



The VT-78 DECstation is a complete computer system, capable of
editing, compiling, and assembling an unlimited variety
of scientific, industrial, business, and educational programs.

Sit back and enjoy a three-minute demonstration of the DECstation
Operating System, OS/78.

Control of the DECstation will remain under control of OS/78 in
BATCH mode for the entire time, so don't try to type anything.




